    "displayName": "Large Covalex Shipment Needs Recovering",
    "titleSource": "localized_clean",
    "titleConfidence": "high",
    "briefing": "Hi, it's El.\n\nNeed a hauler for a job ASAP. One of our contractors had a \"personal emergency\" and had to ditch their ship and it seems like they're not coming back. Not ideal, really.\n\nGood news is the cargo is still intact, at least according to the tracker. It'd be a huge win for me if you could finish the job by grabbing the cargo at [Location] and bringing it to the freight elevator at [Destination].\n\nSeems like this was a pretty big one, you'll need a ship that can transport [MissionMaxSCUSize] cargo containers and a heavy-duty tractor beam to move it all. Really appreciate your help.\n\n[Contractor]\n\nElla Tieno \nJr. Logistics Coordinator \nCovalex Shipping   \n'Anything you need, anywhere you need it.' \n\nCovalex Shipping is a limited liability corporation. To encourage timely deliveries and prevent fraud on cargo hauls, Covalex Shipping will set a delivery time limit and upon expiration, any undelivered cargo will be considered stolen and treated as such. Total payment will be prorated according to the percentage of cargo successfully delivered.",
    "rawName": "@Covalex_RecoverCargo_Hard_Title",
